
*** PLACE Application Examples (Version 2.20) ***

File Name (.PSF)  Device   Description
================  ======   =================================================

 ------------
| PEEL Array |
 ------------
DEMO1A            PA7024   Demonstration design for PA7024 which includes
                           Basic Gates and Registers, 8-bit Down Counter,
                           2-bit State Machine, 4-bit Shift Register and
                           8-bit Bidirecional I/O Port.
BI_PORT           PA7024   8-bit Bidirecional I/O Port (part of DEMO1A.PSF).
COUNTER1          PA7024   8-bit Down Counter with Preset, Reset and Hold
                           (part of DEMO1A.PSF).
GATES1            PA7024   Basic Gates (part of DEMO1A.PSF).
REG1              PA7024   Basic Registers, 8-bit Down Counter, 2-bit State
                           Machine and 4-bit Shift Register (all are part of
                           the DEMO1A.PSF)
TIMER             PA7024   16-Bit Programmable Clock Generator/Interrupt Timer
JACK7024          PA7024   Blackjack Machine Example

TC7140            PA7140   Programmable Clock Generator and Timer/Interrupt
                           Counter
ST7128            PA7128   8-bit Loadable Counter and 4-bit State Machine

 --------------
| PEEL Devices |
 --------------
V8GATES           18CV8    Basic Logic Gates.
V8REGS            18CV8    Basic Registers and Latches.
V8CLKADD          18CV8    Clock Divider Address Decoder.
V8BUSMUX          18CV8    Bus Programmable 8 to 1 Multiplexer.
V8FCNTR           18CV8    8-bit Counter with Function Controls.
V8CPORT           18CV8    Change-of-State Input Port with Interrupt.
V8SYNC            18CV8    Synchronization Circuits.
V10CNT8           22CV10   8-bit Up/Down Loadable Counter with Carry-out or
                           Borrow-in.
PARV10A           22CV10A  9-bit Even/Odd Parity Generator/Checker.
V10ZPORT          22CV10Z  Change-of-State Input Port with Interrupt.



